CORE
streaming_concatenation3.sv

^\[main\.p1\] main\.s1 == 171: PROVED .*$
^\[main\.p2\] main\.s2 == 186: PROVED .*$
^\[main\.p3\] main\.s3 == 213: PROVED .*$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^Invariant check failed$
--
Per 1800-2017 11.4.14, the stream_concatenation of a streaming
concatenation may contain more than one stream_expression, e.g.
{>>{a, b}} or {<<4{a, b}}. Such streaming concatenations are packed into a
single bit vector (preserving written order) and, for the left-shift form,
reversed in blocks of the slice size.
